    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec gc-soft\" id=\"ultimi\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><div class=\"gc-head\"><div><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">From the Journal</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Latest articles</h2></div><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/\">All articles</a></div><div class=\"nv-grid\"><a class=\"nv-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/magazine/what-are-walter-albini-s-clothing-lines/\"><span class=\"nv-card-im\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/quali-sono-le-linee-di-abbigliamento-di-walter-albini-2/walter.jpg\" alt=\"What are Walter Albini&#39;s clothing lines?\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"nv-card-cat\">Magazine</span><span class=\"nv-card-t\">What are Walter Albini&#39;s clothing lines?</span><span class=\"nv-card-d\">Walter Albini marked the birth of Italian ready-to-wear with iconic lines such as &#8220;Unimax&#8221; and the Anagrafe collection,&#8230;</span></a><a class=\"nv-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/magazine/news/autumn-2023-fashion-colours-fabrics-and-accessories-not-to-be-missed/\"><span class=\"nv-card-im\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/moda-autunno-2023-colori-tessuti-e-accessori-da-non-perdere/autunno-inverno-2023-aticolo.jpeg\" alt=\"Autumn 2023 fashion: colours, fabrics and accessories not to be missed\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"nv-card-cat\">Magazine</span><span class=\"nv-card-t\">Autumn 2023 fashion: colours, fabrics and accessories not to be missed</span><span class=\"nv-card-d\">Autumn is upon us and with it the desire to renew our wardrobe with the most popular garments and accessories of the season.&#8230;</span></a><a class=\"nv-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/designers/yves-saint-laurent/\"><span class=\"nv-card-im\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/yves-saint-laurent/yves.jpg\" alt=\"Yves Saint Laurent\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"nv-card-cat\">Designers</span><span class=\"nv-card-t\">Yves Saint Laurent</span><span class=\"nv-card-d\">Yves Saint Laurent was one of the greatest and most influential designers of the 20th century, capable of transforming&#8230;</span></a><a class=\"nv-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/designers/stilisti-italiani/gianni-versace/\"><span class=\"nv-card-im\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/gianni-versace/gianni-e-donatella-versace.jpg\" alt=\"Gianni Versace\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"nv-card-cat\">Designers</span><span class=\"nv-card-t\">Gianni Versace</span><span class=\"nv-card-d\">Gianni Versace was one of the biggest names in Italian fashion in the world, as well as the founder of the Versace fashion&#8230;</span></a><a class=\"nv-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/magazine/ranking-italian-fashion-bloggers-2023/\"><span class=\"nv-card-im\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/classifica-fashion-blogger-italiane-2023/fashion-blogger-fumetto.jpeg\" alt=\"Ranking: Italian fashion bloggers 2023\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"nv-card-cat\">Magazine</span><span class=\"nv-card-t\">Ranking: Italian fashion bloggers 2023</span><span class=\"nv-card-d\">Fashion bloggers are true style icons, who share their passions, their outfits and their fashion advice through social&#8230;</span></a><a class=\"nv-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/magazine/riccardo-gay-model-management/\"><span class=\"nv-card-im\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/riccardo-gay-model-management/riccardo-gay.jpg\" alt=\"Riccardo Gay Model Management\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"nv-card-cat\">Magazine</span><span class=\"nv-card-t\">Riccardo Gay Model Management</span><span class=\"nv-card-d\">The story of Riccardo Gay Model Management Riccardo Gay Model Management was born in the 1960s in Milan, thanks to Riccardo&#8230;</span></a></div></div></section></div>"
