    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec\" id=\"categorie\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">The Journal</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Journal sections</h2><p class=\"gc-lead\">Eight sections to guide you through designers, fashion houses, faces and trends.</p><div class=\"nv-cats\"><a class=\"nv-cat\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/category/?cat=stilisti\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/yves-saint-laurent/yves.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"nv-cat-t\"><b>Designers</b><span>8 articles &#183; Biographies of the great names in fashion</span></span></a><a class=\"nv-cat\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/category/?cat=case-di-moda\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/fendi/fendi.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"nv-cat-t\"><b>Fashion houses</b><span>7 articles &#183; History and logos of the maisons</span></span></a><a class=\"nv-cat\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/category/?cat=moda-e-star\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/film-e-programmi-tv-di-anna-wintour/anna-diavolo.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"nv-cat-t\"><b>Fashion &amp; stars</b><span>9 articles &#183; Faces, music and style</span></span></a><a class=\"nv-cat\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/category/?cat=modelle\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/classifica-modelle-piu-pagate-di-sempre/classifica-modelle.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"nv-cat-t\"><b>Models</b><span>5 articles &#183; The top models of yesterday and today</span></span></a><a class=\"nv-cat\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/category/?cat=classifiche\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/classifica-stilisti-italiani-piu-influenti-della-storia/stilisi-italiani-piu-influenti.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"nv-cat-t\"><b>Rankings</b><span>11 articles &#183; Reasoned lists of the best</span></span></a><a class=\"nv-cat\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/category/?cat=fotografi-di-moda\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/posts/richard-avedon/RichardAvedon.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"nv-cat-t